    "updated_at": "2021-12-08T08:17:53Z",
    "body": "No, you'd want something dedicated in CSSOM for this. Mutation observer is only good for node tree mutations and the computed style can change due to changes outside of that. I recommend opening an issue at https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/new for discussion. (Or perhaps they already have one, haven't checked.)",
